{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226260","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1222626001:1":{"text":"어라, 발자국이 갑자기 사라졌어요!","source_cn":"咦，脚印怎么突然消失了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7AB414EA8FB3958","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222626002:1":{"text":"보... 보니는 어디로 간 걸까요?","source_cn":"她……她去哪里了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0D77F6E7362ACB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1222626002":{"text":"보... 보니는 어디로 간 걸까요?","source_cn":"她……她去哪里了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0D77F6E7362ACB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222626003:1":{"text":"그렇다면... 이 발자국은 보니가 처음부터 일부러 남긴 걸까요?","source_cn":"难道说……这些脚印从一开始就是波妮故意留下的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D6EE3CE3806FB73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222626004:1":{"text":"도망칠 때 연막탄까지 잊지 않은 걸 보니, 역시 호드킨이 아끼는 부하다워.","source_cn":"逃跑时还不忘放烟雾弹，不愧是霍德希金的爱将。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8695501E42C26CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222626005:1":{"text":"발자국이 가짜라면 큰일 난 것 아닌가요? 저희가 빙 돌아오는 사이, 벌써 멀리 도망쳐버렸을 거예요!","source_cn":"脚印是假的？那不是糟糕了吗？我们兜了圈子，她肯定已经跑远了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABE60622A57397C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222626006:1":{"text":"꼭 그렇지만도 않아. 일부러 흔적을 남겨 우리를 속이는 바람에 오히려 자신이 도망칠 시간을 지체했을 테니까.","source_cn":"不见得，她故意留下痕迹误导我们，反而耽搁了自己逃跑的时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70048B6967271BAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222626007:1":{"text":"그러네요. 저희가 일부러 그녀를 놓아줬을 거라는 건 아마 생각지도 못했을 거예요.","source_cn":"对哦，我们也是故意放她离开的，她一定没想到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29A7C5103FBC2A0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222626008:1":{"text":"맞아. 그러니 아마 멀리 가지는 못했을 거야. 다른 길로 계속 쫓아가도록 하지!","source_cn":"没错，所以我猜她没跑远。换另外一条路，继续追吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB74F676FD922C0DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"함정이다","source_cn":"我们中计了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1930ABF8DB5EF953","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"함정이다","female":"함정이다","variant_male_record_index":"67050","variant_female_record_index":"67051","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","